>1. How do you run it in Wizard mode ? What is the difference between Debug 
>   and Discovery Modes ?
>
In Debug, you can wish for as much stuff as you want.  You can also,
magic map, level teleport, and find the location of special levels at
will (as well as other stuff).  In Discovery, you start with a wand of
wishing, but everything else is as if you were playing a normal game
(you do not get on the high score list in either of these modes).
Read the FAQ for the syntax on getting into these modes (I don't know
off the top of my head).

